Running C.5.1–C.5.3 with `-max 256` reproduces the RFC dynamic table exactly (`[1] set-cookie`, `[2] content-encoding: gzip`, `[3] date: ...:22 GMT`, size 215), confirming FIFO eviction driven by decoded byte sizes.
